          "expr": "(\n  1 - (sum by (rule_name) (max by (rule_name, org) (repo_guardian_repos_actionable)) / scalar(sum(max by (org) (repo_guardian_repos_tracked))))\n)\nand on() (sum(max by (org) (repo_guardian_repos_tracked)) \u003e 0)",
