      "title": "Open repo-guardian PRs by age",
      "description": "CAVEAT: this series is incremented by whichever replica performs a check and reset only by the replica holding the sweep lock, so on a multi-replica deployment a non-leader's copy accumulates rather than reflecting the current open set. Read the shape, not the absolute number, until it is re-derived from the store.",
