      "title": "Check failure rate",
      "description": "Share of repository checks that errored. Matches the expression behind RepoGuardianHighErrorRate, which pages above 10%. clamp_min keeps the ratio defined when no check has completed in the window; without it an idle fleet divides by zero and reads NaN, which nobody can tell from a broken exporter.",
